📊 Visualization and Seasonal Analysis of Monthly Data
🧠 Overview

This project explores monthly data visualization and trend analysis using Python.
It demonstrates how to create pie charts, stacked bar charts, and perform seasonal decomposition to understand both proportions and patterns over time.

The analysis focuses on upper and lower value comparisons for three years — 2022, 2023, and 2024 — to uncover how they vary seasonally and proportionally.
